  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fOh3/11",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">제목 그대로의 내용입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c9f526249cb15bb2ffcd46c84c0ccf696ab97a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c9f526249cb15bb2ffcd46c84c0ccf696ab97a7\" data-origin-width=\"1152\" data-origin-height=\"1306\"></div><p>골든 로드 종이의 색 바꾸기?</p><p>너무 재밌어보이는 겁니다.</p><p>그런데 이걸 알기 직전에 과학 물품 한 번에 품의해버려서</p><p>이거 하나 하자고 품의하기 귀찮아 그냥 내돈내산 했습니다.</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size23\"><b>재밌잖아요.</b></span></p><p>그리고 제빵소다 수용액...</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70f83ca075e2250fbdd03463f503d382ab45854a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70f83ca075e2250fbdd03463f503d382ab45854a\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"436\"></div><p>실험하고 남은 거 모으면 되지. 마침 네 반 모두 실험 끝.</p><p>그렇게 용액이 준비되었고</p><p>이제 꽃을 만듭니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39fc34dad4d9f39ae30c40aa20bcef91ccd06dba\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39fc34dad4d9f39ae30c40aa20bcef91ccd06dba\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"773\"></div><p>수선화를 할까 하다가 그래도 빨간색이 될 거면 장미꽃으로 해야지 생각했습니다(하나도 안중요함.)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPNNx_xPQis\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPNNx_xPQis</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPNNx_xPQis\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/g5vSN/dJMb9b4cMqR/uhQF2Rau9xtvRSvEPpLNW0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bgoOcK/dJMb9frZ8yO/NqKfeOjZ2ZR57SMSCycM20/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kmJvv/dJMb9dHI3sj/gOdWfwMlPnbjMEHNVyrEvk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CPNNx_xPQis\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>이걸 보고 열심히 접어서 학생부 선생님들께 먼저 자랑하고</p><p>퍼포먼스를 하고 싶어서 갑자기 3학년실에 갑니다(상담실 같은 층)</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8da916f60387aa9ea41a193d24d43abed3276564\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"646\" style=\"width:48.28%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8da916f60387aa9ea41a193d24d43abed3276564\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41c8faf6be0cf709bf538d8fe07c17f8ec5557a7\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"603\" style=\"width:51.72%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41c8faf6be0cf709bf538d8fe07c17f8ec5557a7\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>3학년 선생님들 반응: ...</p><p>&#160;</p><p>죄송합니다.</p><p>피드백 내용 - 제가 있는 쪽에서 뿌리니까 반대편에선 잘 안느껴졌다고</p><p>애들 앞에선 옆에서 뿌려야 되는 걸 깨달았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f2dc46c41bc7ed03f13befb5ec4cba7bbdafec0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f2dc46c41bc7ed03f13befb5ec4cba7bbdafec0\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">빨갛게잘물들었습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ae499d03c6810834cc865f55bbd36fce60cc8b0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ae499d03c6810834cc865f55bbd36fce60cc8b0\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">점점늘어나는종이접기실력<br>사실 색변화 잘 보이려면 평평한 수선화가 나은 것 같기도…</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}